# Hat in Hand (windurst 0): tier 4's completion (the main flow's rare Windshear Hat is already held by then). Accepted
# with the New Model Hat (GMs), QuestHatInHand_count 6 and the show-off NPCs' bits QuestHatInHand_var 255 (a GM; the
# main flow never sets it): 52 (50), option 1: the Windshear Hat, 400 gil, fame 10, both vars 0 (npcUtil.completeQuest's
# var list), completed, the New Model Hat taken, needToZone.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-65.0,-2.9,-145.7 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.HatInHand accepted
keyitem NewModelHat
charvar QuestHatInHand_count 6
charvar QuestHatInHand_var 255
login
trigger Baren-Moren                     # the hat, count 6: 52 (50), tier 4
finish option=1                         # the Windshear Hat; 400 gil; both vars 0; completed; the hat taken; needToZone
